# Click "Send Request" above each request (VS Code: REST Client extension; also works in Visual Studio / Rider).
# Start the database and the API first (see README).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5018

### The monthly usage report (last 12 months, current month flagged as partial)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/monthly-usage

### Fewer months
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/monthly-usage?months=3

### Invalid: months out of range -> 400 problem+json
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/monthly-usage?months=0
